{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_016_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e5b4ebab726af50588b364cb9f4883ddbbbfd3fa1d0a2039dce122a7161f23e4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f735643448c6861b5486d8556ebd7eb6ff886bd017c90e5affd783c4e5d3922",
      "text": "用料理克服讨厌的蔬菜？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88ac8890e07c04e61e393cffe23d70d3c6afcff77c31abf7dbc02cb2017b4c51",
      "text": "某个休息日，制作人被诚司叫了出来。诚司希望能借用事务所的厨房，做一些能帮天音克服挑食蔬菜的料理。他还拜托制作人帮忙试吃……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f735643448c6861b5486d8556ebd7eb6ff886bd017c90e5affd783c4e5d3922",
      "text": "用料理克服讨厌的蔬菜？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:807174a4434a7b6ad65b08c4e7a421dc636c2f055694d6a31f001d7032bf8aeb",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー。\n明明是休息日，还把你叫到事务所来，实在抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b36fa0a95242e39cf3337254b188ae1ba3653da65d307968a96e5b4f0477f22f",
      "text": "没关系的，不用在意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7209af5418eebda407b5a597867b36a7d17f62e031bf5a989bfe8646d17231cf",
      "text": "（严肃的表情……而且，信玄先生的\n氛围跟平时不太一样……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:626ab7da56a30d89977b526aae1760290adec5522b2c18bd9d4850df1cb37e93",
      "text": "（难道说是工作上出了什么事吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ffe3f8c5038a0b49b5f0b4dc598f52820e0c8a6ad82362b86aaef2a61b677d7",
      "text": "能听你这么说真是帮了大忙。\n……其实我有事想郑重拜托制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:086a8bada3aea6cdcb50b7aa6dd2ccb83ca87624bec58536c08110b45c3bd714",
      "text": "是一件私事。\n我也纠结过该不该拜托你……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32fcef2ec003c0b6c7e2ebcd398bea1e40fc21d8a416ddbeec8a53850dc363b5",
      "text": "唯独这件事需要借助他人之力。\n可以拜托你吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba0938f4c57a8e4c824282992be77f4098cba52d4ad6204cf3d64b236b17268d",
      "text": "明白了。\n只要是我力所能及的事，我什么都愿意做！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:459e5d8d1bd889042d9717f7b4e1bfabebee1b89cafb0adaba3b3da25463e397",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a7746cba20878925d5f58cf61ca9fee2771fb8fe38b9216b51586edd8a9b702",
      "text": "事不宜迟，我所托之事其实是……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
